{"stamp":"42fde27da9ad82f9","protocol":{"sets":"lda-sr, pbe-sr (scalar), lda-fr, pbe-fr (Dirac), upaw (on demand, lda)","tolerance_rule":"tol = 100 x floor, never above the old looser value (tables 1e-9 of max, scalars 1e-8, ill-conditioned 1e-6); function cases on frozen inputs default 1e-12; floors: threads 1 vs 4 rerun (bitwise so far) and 1-ulp input perturbation (fixed seeds) in function cases","pointwise_rule":"|a-b| <= tol*|b| + 1e-9*max|b| (plan 3.4)","npz_regeneration":"run this script with `run --all` (regenerates every npz while the Python generator exists); copy the npz to dev_plan/freeze_archive/ before A7","dataset_function_recipes":{"input":"the dataset of the shipped file (lib_*) or, for gen_*, the codec payload at stride 4 (to_payload(pp, 4): _table, 10 digits) stored as ds_* arrays in gen_*_inputs.npz and rebuilt with paw.from_payload","log_derivative_paw":"per l: reference energies, their midpoints and [-3,-1,-0.5,-0.25,-0.1,0,0.1,0.3,1.0] Ha at radius projector_radius(l); the first 3 energies again at that radius + 0.25","paw_spectrum":"per l: paw_spectrum(pp, l, 3) with the default extents","reconstruct_ae":"per l: r = linspace(0.02, 9.0, 449), u = r**(l+1)*exp(-0.8*r)","local_potential":"inside = linspace(r0, r_max, 41); mixed = concat([0, 0.5*r0, r0, 1.0, 2.5], inside[1:-1], [r_max, 1.0001*r_max, 1.5*r_max, 40.0, 100.0]); beyond = [1.01*r_max, 1.3*r_max, 40.0, 100.0]; scalars = [0.5*r0, 1.7, 1.2*r_max]; scipy CubicSpline(r, v_local), not-a-knot; flat below r0, -Z/r beyond r_max","multipole_moments":"every l1 <= l2 and L in multipole_range, bases dual and raw; L <= 2 when an f channel exists","intruding_s_miss":"the l = 0 part of a hydrogen 1s centered at r_cut + 0.2 expanded in the projectors and smooth waves; empty acceptance iff miss < 1.0 (strict)","numbers":"floats stored with 15 significant digits (compared at 1e-13 relative); the digests (sha256/blob) are the bitwise gate"},"layout":{"gen_<set>_<El>.json":"generated dataset: scalars, ghost_free attempt table, `arrays` (sha256 of the float64 bytes, shape, max, 8 samples at sample_index(n, peak, 8); the npz copy is `d_<name>` in gen_*_data.npz at stride ceil(n/2000), points a[stride-1::stride]), atom (`a_<name>`), function_cases (inputs in gen_*_inputs.npz, outputs `o_<sha>` at stride ceil(n/3000)), floors","lib_<set>_<El>.json":"shipped file read through the Python codec: sha256 of every from_payload array (names in lib_names.json via names_id) and, for FUNCTION_SAMPLE, the dataset-level function cases","refuse_*.json":"ghosts='repair' on a flagged lanthanide: the 33-attempt refusal","census_<set>.json":"inferred ghost_free attempt of all 92 shipped files per set","vs_library_14bohr.json":"generated stride-4 tables vs the shipped file, inside/beyond 14 Bohr"},"notes":["Mode: ghosts='repair' (the mandacaru-build default) except the three lanthanide sets (lda-sr Ce, lda-fr Ce, pbe-sr Ce), which the shipped library holds as FLAGGED datasets: they are frozen with ghosts='flag' (least defective attempt by _defect_badness); repair refuses lda-sr Ce after 33 attempts (refuse_lda-sr_Ce.json).","Floor: the dataset arrays and scalars are BITWISE identical between OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 and 4 (floor exactly 0: the radial context is single-threaded by design), so 100 x floor is 0 and unusable; the operative floor is the 1-ulp perturbation of the function cases (floor key of each case) with a minimum tol of 1e-12 relative to max for function cases on frozen inputs.","The diagnostics group (duality_error, asymmetry, consistency_error, norm_error) is roundoff-level (1-ulp moves 0.3-2 of its own value): compare it by order of magnitude only, never at tol.  log_derivative_paw near a pole (values of order 30-40 at the stored energies) has a relative floor that blows up: gate it on the phase / absolute value.","Dirac matrices have a 1-ulp floor of 1e-9..1e-6 of max (Au worst, 1.2e-6); the Dirac tol is 100 x that, not 1e-12.","The shipped lda-fr files of Fe, Au and Pb differ from today's generator at O(1) (cutoffs, local shift, one-center energy by 5-142 Ha): they are stale (plan 3.1 names Au among nine frozen elements and 26 unnamed semicore ones); lda-fr Na and Ce are not (3e-8 / 1.4e-4). The oracle for the Dirac port is this freeze, not the file."]},"generated":{"lda-fr/Au":{"n_points":118500,"mode":"repair","attempts":1,"selected_index":0,"selected_label":"first construction","repaired":false,"error":null,"n_tried":0,"defects":{"ghosts":{},"phases":{}},"seconds":270.8,"peak_footprint_mb":135,"rerun_bit_identical":["130/130"],"rerun_tables_rel":[0.0],"rerun_scalars_abs":[0.0],"vs_library_tables_rel":24.726460192452773,"function_cases":{"_hartree_energy":2,"_local_derivatives":1,"_xc_energies":4,"assemble_paw_channel":10,"intruding_s_miss":1,"j_resolved_spin_orbit":1,"pseudize_density":1},"dataset_level":["intruding_s_miss","local_potential","log_derivative_paw","multipole_moments","paw_spectrum","reconstruct_ae"],"intruding_s_miss":0.21245117327697974,"npz_bytes":{"data":1187080,"inputs":30620010}},"lda-fr/Ce":{"n_points":87000,"mode":"flag","attempts":33,"selected_index":8,"selected_label":"own cutoffs, shift 40","repaired":true,"error":null,"n_tried":32,"defects":{"ghosts":{},"phases":{"3":[0.28483542793768146,0.28483542793768146]},"unprojected":{"1":1.187687558858022,"2":1.3585720009260998,"4":0.20977718455360073}},"seconds":356.6,"peak_footprint_mb":108,"rerun_bit_identical":["62/62"],"rerun_tables_rel":[0.0],"rerun_scalars_abs":[0.0],"vs_library_tables_rel":0.00014176848274482932,"function_cases":{"_hartree_energy":2,"_local_derivatives":1,"_xc_energies":4,"assemble_paw_channel":4,"intruding_s_miss":6,"j_resolved_spin_orbit":1,"pseudize_density":1},"dataset_level":["intruding_s_miss","local_potential","log_derivative_paw","multipole_moments","paw_spectrum","reconstruct_ae"],"intruding_s_miss":0.26034938502061566,"npz_bytes":{"data":747581,"inputs":15441728}},"lda-fr/Fe":{"n_points":39000,"mode":"repair","attempts":1,"selected_